{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel Defense is a dynamic roguelike game in which every battle turns into a test of strength. Collect an arsenal, upgrade your mech and find your own way to victory in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 types of weapons with unique upgrades that unlock new tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional items for flexible customization and enhancement of the mech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that require a different approach to combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses who will test your skills and reward you as you deserve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards, for the best of the best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A workshop for training and developing combat characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready and show what you can do!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927680?t=1759937728","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927680/3a67b6c0d0ae5c71d48532fde2d6b5d7c392abeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759937728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927680/eda9397a8ae08105ef0a0fbe018b919b6566ca48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759937728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927680/eda9397a8ae08105ef0a0fbe018b919b6566ca48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759937728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragr